    title: "js/ts: a workspace sibling reached through a module object (require('@ws/b').helper), a namespace import (C.shout) or a default import still calls a tier-3 @ws/ phantom; WI-rilof fixed only named bindings"  # 6f74
    status: todo_hard  # 6f74
    priority: 2  # 6f74
    parent:  # 6f74
    tags:  # 6f74
